title: parlament unionist coalition

You should not be here? Report a bug if you see this text.

@psc_cs
title: PSC-led <span class="generalitat-coalition" data-parties="psc" data-summary="Minority government with Cs support"><span style="color: var(--cs); font-style: italic;">Moderation</span> Government</span> with Cs support
